{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1569,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0596b6c686ed5897d82e85c5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "太强了，希望之城实在太强了！\\n这是堪称横纲相扑般的碾压表现！\\n日本的沙土上已再无敌手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ab97e8adcf5c0ca21bfc5a790c0f8775d4ccdb9bf0a1ccf6dac4ed170184e5d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a2029fa0432360383f7663d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "信念果然一跃而出！\\n快速少女信念，在这平坦的逆时针新潟赛场上\\n夺取了GⅠ头衔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a736d56225c8e1542aa8cbe9ce5eee986d6ae493d74510775c9ad1436e6cf46",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4180"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c53de15636c6b34510632f99",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "赢了！烈焰快驹，制霸GⅠ！\\n终于在这场宝冢纪念赛中赢下了GⅠ冠军！\\n正是烈焰快驹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62e1ff445c4e0ec27220712ccf3bdcf099d44f4a6346a7bc3b65127df8fe9da3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddf555e7c7fb89a7630a52a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是迷人景致！\\n唯我才是女王！迷人景致！\\n出色地在这场大赛舞台上将绝景收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63f2a033aeef60fc8881cfc6de318fe2e392dae8130809d3a59186775bc2cb97",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c88b557b956451547a1463d5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "黄金旅程！黄金旅程正在追赶！\\n超越她！黄金旅程！黄金旅程！\\n黄金旅程——！反超了——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9db14647707ccab60f5f3f0b041a86ee627ebe79279a47f2e7640ed4f10cfe73",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39454e07728868d8ef5f6375",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "啊，是神业！\\n虽然是久违的复出战，但早早地就占据了前方位置",
      "source_fingerprint": "2544251c29684dc4d25f1d08238ecbca9060cab9988bcc06a592118caf5afdf0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f45a7872fbbf25090bff851",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "奇迹般的末脚！\\n撕碎雨幕，在这场豪雨之中神业获得第一！\\n这就是奇迹般的末脚，制霸了菊花赏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "758d5595a19f0b58ec34c14ba92aed575a642e35f6ce910bfae27f97d8abec0f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ecab7182f11cf4c5b02ac7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "感人的剧本，以强烈的个性俘获了粉丝的心，\\n作为“最强”的赛马娘刻下了蹄迹！\\n正是莱斯莱斯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a96befa5cb2a73bc8386e7f20a18d4b7338f33bc26319778b2816ad34f69d578",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:863a137db5102deb93da638d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "对这位赛马娘来说，三冠也仅仅是中途点！\\n创造新历史的赛马娘，正是杏目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30074442382d1a93f1a58baa23190f22712e2beb7402f0458fe12269bc05a1a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c4919e050eafc13a8222ca",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "长久的英里之路在此迎来终点\n王者将要诞生！　英里冠军赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "061ec3b28d4eb80417cc09e76270bc38fa6c01cd5aa2272351d3a82c3da03cda",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91749ddc15f3da88c5142217",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "全世界的赛马娘们追求着荣光\n聚集在日本杯的府中赛场！\n日本势力能够与之抗衡吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52fc4144fab9bce9aae6119d28194d450886d3eb262a74904fbb1ee5f032b424",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "43"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35e37bd8ae978b032516734",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%horse1\n有些动摇",
      "source_fingerprint": "d168d4ee788e1b1bc527ea2a287ad9d92b59a47e6e56529d373bd2f39737f715",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ac51b9b851c8569965e2100",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%horse1\n好像陷入困境了",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae28fe00b5ed8e0ab2a26de72a191ea73f8803792f9976bb490bbe16788d5c9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:558413cf40e8d82c0c4af7b0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "追求沙上之战的强者们聚集于此！\n沙土之王决定战，冠军杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af6a9fcc930fc455c9993a16367b024ef5d16342d8790b9c476308b1afb2c267",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dec71f8b910aa7d210fa4ef",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "寒冷的阪神场地上聚集了拥有热血之心的若驹们！\n通向经典赛之路，阪神两岁雌马大赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "256d8413539e347a3f776570a334c13803018375cdda7791518b1fc7f9304a50",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce303bfe5899f92284014403",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "经典赛之路的登龙门\n朝日杯未来锦标！\n道路从这里开拓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca20d9c0e32fdf5b3c5ed6b318fd4fe10c6f076b3edae63fd4a7bb2826c20df0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36106ae89c296a51700cc3a4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "在年末的中山赛场进行的梦之大奖赛・有马纪念！\n你我的梦想，能够化作现实吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d32638324ea8ff970afbbf1fa6e2d58e06f473c00f9644ec800b9a3de9a3ff2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:765e440ab425ea61727eb2f7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "令所有人着迷，魂牵梦绕的希望之星即将诞生！\n希望锦标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd6ee1f50487856b01fe2b202645e70741b4579616117874abc287320db8aea",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbcbce00ab38d21bbd00a0bc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "通过日积月累的训练积蓄力量的赛马娘们\n终于将要登上比赛的舞台！\n训练赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5333e4aaf7844c8fe3c5858260b2c57bc8dbd2723163efe070deafa317b0ec5c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7862fd9483d28e101c9ca6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "万里无云的青空之下，%course\n%ground%distance%race\n%h_num_no赛马娘前来挑战",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e4c6853dcfe529ccf2612a952a3fcc248d1d987fe1d239802b5bd8074d66d5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f9feddab494088627928981",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "拥有潜力的赛马娘们\n第一次登场于正式的舞台之上！\n初学者之战开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1611cbcfd0654f27be5fe31b7267c47bc4b3f2be80a713b3eaf690f4411dc61e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64b644145d3d2662b4ffc68",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "领先的是%a_h_rank1！\\n%a_h_rank2追了上来",
      "source_fingerprint": "5209629d231b1fdf690c3748e79eed7be020dcb73f9cc1e29ee77f88ae0d2447",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0324f9940f1f4415bfc42f3a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "领先的是%a_h_rank1！\\n%h_rank2\\n%h_rank3追了上来",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3adb1fafa1c187eef72572cef4729f9836a096b7903bbe45a67382a6f3c494b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d624dfa3fd9aabe239e6e34",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "领先的是%a_h_rank1！\\n%h_rank2紧咬不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cec30e84f1bf18692e8bceba669823842aa02dbdcc974623ae7766f7a4e4fda",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17e7f1da1b0c6d2862ca07b4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "领先的是%a_h_rank1！\\n%h_rank2\\n%h_rank3紧追不放！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb9552ae70cb8236ed16808a753d83570b828367f0c10e39ea2584e3b9ef60b0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3c5ac25ddea78304a473d3",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%a_h_rank2缩小了差距",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d15b1a2a34155c98779b305e01235afd621aa4795c46ed65b527327b908f034",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b236278bc6aee41306c8785c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank1！\n能坚持下去吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc1fd4c9bf5e4e98294578dcf2c5bbb9ae3c0cef35c178c54c74bda0a93590b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71a064f7a31bba5655b5bbd1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "领头者仍未改变，%a_h_rank1",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5263896036d016d628311005a3c5b712c4829db0fca21ee21c4a169a467084",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:530532670b0259e2fa571c62",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "前方依然是%a_h_rank1",
      "source_fingerprint": "db664a853773b1a80556cd9cf1084048b39ffac9b28efaac9f65376316d1624c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39bcb663caecbe091341040e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank1，好强的脚力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8ee209375bb5fc44694390d7fc510ca5f046d8e066af44f6f85db1091a8cae7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a12d0ce9ff7e629fbecfd4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_a2%h_rank_to1\n两人并列冲线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d57f6385380374d3627864460a8142965e6987fcbd960ce895d99f4edcb7fc7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccfab3d76cd60edb59efde43",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank1\n%h_rank2追过来了\n两人并列冲线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5ebbee7e00e7500d3c9a6ee7a84575b1d190fc1a3a262c50459a8c1ac5f888b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0ce9f5562c6c584e136156",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank2\n%h_rank1追过来了\n两人并列冲线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4def2b1739f3a1509489840e31ab56aab7dad5f1dc50d0f2d56c969c5f7945e6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e25b778f46cabfb43739255",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_a1%h_rank_to2\n纠缠着冲过了终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59d179b97e2d2af32d3c2819aeab362bb799f9f8349bc368f35c977d4a62e007",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e9f48221454e494811c8662",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_a2%h_rank_to1\n纠缠着冲过了终点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c73ed95f322263b46693722828f16b08bd3b48ec5dd565daca02a0576769d259",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707a78422c5e3bee6ff02cca",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从容的奔跑！\n她迅速甩开了对手\n保证了领先地位！",
      "source_fingerprint": "666edd0672d1b5a533c4269c582c407cbeddc3a0b0820e530712cf107888913b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a2fa53677d42a480be834f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "从容的奔跑！\n第二名没能缩小与她的差距\n已经是压倒性胜利了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a2308aa03918f1bb431fb35122c5ae436a58bf9f49994ad747663b9aca1051",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb852149d0052a36ad762ba",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "胜者是%h_rank_ta1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf386423b65ef0adb84d8a73997554d31f7991258877c493322538308b5ff24d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93737a78b54c1eddabaaee9c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1！　斩获了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3acf4a61278b94d4594131a0ef09d7cf5245278685115e6e17acec57ea2ab96",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:478de566ab6d5b7ae82ff031",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "%h_rank_l1，精彩获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "90bb337e7cb9877c64ff4bf32d6182c9e488162fa92beee1ad74c87d4c042834",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ed4e87b29569bcb503c9ce",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "与未来相连的重要一战\n赛马娘将全身心投入比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bc2a0d0d17c826db91a388983dedb62d927a4997158829b9ea3abda199a0b93",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bed8d043013a82345f49705",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "获胜的是%h_rank_ta1！\n她战胜了劲敌，\n成功取得了巨大的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b88d79a1637d106e4389c70a4432105a1fbef427462ee50938798ed257716e4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3734b5c7c55b0cf05c43f664",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_message",
      "source_text": "荣誉已经近在眼前了！\n金牛杯决赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "024142f9e25bd83da1b892ce3aef4c7770087e0a9fc574803c04f3e0f7054048",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_message_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "5022"
      ]
